# Build, TOC & packaging

## Non-negotiables

- V1 host: **TBC Classic Anniversary** only — `## Interface: 20506`
- Folder basename must match TOC: `ChurchOfBeef/ChurchOfBeef.toc`
- Expand TOC only for files that exist; never list missing files
- No packager upload / store publish without explicit approval

## Infra gap

No BigWigs packager, `.pkgmeta`, Makefile, or `.github/workflows` yet. Research: `docs/research/wow-classic-addon-design/33-packager-ci-releases/`. Do not invent CI or upload tokens without a task. Backlog: `OPTIMIZATIONS.md`.

## TOC / host

- Re-verify after patches: `/dump select(4, GetBuildInfo())`
- No Retail / Era / Cata / DF multi-TOC for V1
- Prefer backslashes in TOC paths (`Data\Ranks.lua`)
- Keep `ChurchOfBeef*.lua` / TOC casing consistent (case-sensitive packaging)

## SavedVariables (product-load-bearing)

```toc
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: ChurchOfBeefDB
```

Per-character is intentional (alts start Fresh Beef). Do not switch to account-wide. SV caches officer-committed state + local testimony — not a server.

## Phase 0 install / zip

From checkout that has `addon/` (often `.worktrees/feat-church-of-beef-v1/`):

```bash
cp -R addon/ChurchOfBeef "$WOW_ADDONS_DIR/ChurchOfBeef"
cd addon && zip -r ../ChurchOfBeef.zip ChurchOfBeef
```

Zip/install root = `ChurchOfBeef/` (not the monorepo). Wrong name → silent “addon missing.” Keep `docs/canon/` out of the zip. Numbers only in `Data/Ranks.lua`. Operational loop: `.cursor/skills/church-of-beef-dev/SKILL.md`.

## Secrets & release

- Never commit `CF_API_KEY`, Wago/WoWI tokens, or put them in Lua/docs
- Do not ship verbose `/beef debug` / alpha spam in guild Release builds
- Future packager (when tasked): `BigWigsMods/packager@v2` with `-t addon/ChurchOfBeef`; untagged → alpha only
